ROLLBACK;
BEGIN;
SELECT set_config('role', 'safesession_lk_user', true),
       set_config('request.jwt.claims', '{"sub": "1"}', true);
     set_config      |  set_config  
---------------------+--------------
 safesession_lk_user | {"sub": "1"}
(1 row)

SELECT ss_lk_set_named('request.jwt.claims');
ERROR:  cannot set a request setting from a call checked only at run time after the role switch in this transaction
DETAIL:  SafeSession could not read the call before it ran, for example because the setting's name was not known when the statement was planned, the call is in a PL/pgSQL expression other than PERFORM, or the query reads a table or calls a function in FROM.
HINT:  pgedge_safesession lets a delegating role (pgedge_safesession.delegating_roles) switch role once per transaction; after that, the role and the settings named by pgedge_safesession.locked_setting_prefixes cannot change.
ROLLBACK;
BEGIN;
SELECT set_config('role', 'safesession_lk_user', true),
       set_config('request.jwt.claims', '{"sub": "1"}', true);
     set_config      |  set_config  
---------------------+--------------
 safesession_lk_user | {"sub": "1"}
(1 row)

SELECT ss_lk_set_named('request.' || 'runtime');
ERROR:  cannot set a request setting from a call checked only at run time after the role switch in this transaction
DETAIL:  Setting "request.runtime" is under a locked prefix and is not held. SafeSession could not read the call before it ran, for example because the setting's name was not known when the statement was planned, the call is in a PL/pgSQL expression other than PERFORM, or the query reads a table or calls a function in FROM.
HINT:  pgedge_safesession lets a delegating role (pgedge_safesession.delegating_roles) switch role once per transaction; after that, the role and the settings named by pgedge_safesession.locked_setting_prefixes cannot change.
ROLLBACK;
\set SHOW_CONTEXT errors
BEGIN;
SELECT set_config('role', 'safesession_lk_user', true),
       set_config('request.jwt.claims', '{"sub": "1"}', true);
     set_config      |  set_config  
---------------------+--------------
 safesession_lk_user | {"sub": "1"}
(1 row)

